  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cinnamon roll French toast brings the cozy magic of a slow weekend morning, with sweet cinnamon swirls and a gentle hint of vanilla in every bite. Thick slices of bread soak in a rich custard filled with warm spices and creamy goodness, then sizzle in butter until golden and fragrant. A drizzle of maple syrup and a spoonful of whipped cream turn it into pure comfort, while brown sugar and cinnamon melt together into that classic, bakery style warmth. Serve cinnamon roll French toast with loved ones and let breakfast feel like a happy memory in the making.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-cinnamon-roll-french-toast\">Why You’ll Love This Cinnamon roll French toast</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-cinnamon-roll-french-toast\">How to Make Cinnamon Roll French Toast</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-cinnamon-roll-french-toast\">Pro Tips for Making Cinnamon roll French toast</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-cinnamon-roll-french-toast\">How to Serve this Cinnamon roll French toast</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-cinnamon-roll-french-toast\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Cinnamon roll French toast</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It’s a delightful twist on classic French toast!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for brunch gatherings or cozy mornings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make with simple ingredients you probably have at home.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Each bite is a warm hug of cinnamon and sweetness.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for meal prep—enjoy it throughout the week!</li